<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta intensified attacks, bombing villages near the Thai border, striking a health centre in a Thai border village and hitting Thai buildings opposite Mae Sam Laep, while warning Thai traders against supplying the KNU. ASEAN’s special envoy met Myanmar’s minister to discuss civil war aid access, and the junta’s airstrike on an IDP camp occurred hours after the envoy left. Japan is lobbying to have Myanmar removed from the global financial watchdog's blacklist and the United States is seeking Myanmar's rare earths, prompting accusations of undermining the EU diplomatic blockade. Thailand suspended unofficial border trade for seven days after artillery shells struck Thai homes in Tak province. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNOUE1aHhNQ1BkVTZYeHpxQzF3NDU1VzZUN1ozMHFRem81U3Z3YW50NXZ3ZUhxbnkteUdWNlhjY29HQjVOZzR4YjFvRWlid21aby1idno4YWZwbURuQ0lxcHhiaW9uRXZHTm1sWU9zT3FON2hfelBUQjNCcWlrZVRla2RrazU5VXU1dktLUmRiSmpkMkdrczBfcFRYTzhvRm9RRGJCMEo0X2IwWnRtQnVqTWNva28xd1NxalBv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOcVY2ZW1UekNrbXdEeE9MNF9UcWR2V2FVVkoyNWU2WXlJXzlwMldvNVA5eTN1RXVGQWRpeGpQN28tamVKRmRSQTFmTTdteUV5ckV4SmZ1Qm1wZ2RBVzVQYXA0aDA3NWJHYWd3SjZkZXVxbUwta2dlb0hwemRHYzhTM1N0T21iNTdreDJ3OENuTEhSMmNBLUZyNFRSOHk2SV9TNUgxSTZuMkxZTHJsU0h4X1BGVEhWREk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPRVJZVmpwcFZkRWpxdl9yRGhiekJySTVrV1JqLUxpZlNpQ0swRzRNSHAzNTBmOVFkcmpzZ212SnVyckZHYmRoMEdaTXAxVEJtYlZiZ0I0OHNqWXZSU00wdS1uY1p2LTMtd1Z6UlExXzFNQU1jOENrN1p0VnhLSElWLWNFTGtscVZmdk0xMThnNFVKMER5bHc5aHNEUHJaTUlDcU9LTmZkSkwtZ21UQnA0azZkV1JOYzBzZ3F0ZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu